  "answer_text": "Here is the contact information for **Advance Auto Parts Human Resources**:\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udcde Advance Auto Parts HR Contact Information\n\n- **HR Support Center Phone Number:** **1-800-380-4681**\n- **HR Support Center Email:** **HRSupportCenter@advance-auto.com**\n\n---\n\n### Additional HR Details:\n\n- Another reported HR phone number is **540-362-4911**, which is listed as a primary contact number for employment-related inquiries.\n\n- Calling the Advance Auto Parts HR number can connect you with a representative who can help with matters such as job applications, employee benefits, interview scheduling, and workplace policies.\n\n- When contacting Advance Auto Parts Human Resources, make sure to call during regular business hours. The HR department is typically available from **10:00 AM to 5:00 PM, Monday through Friday**, excluding public holidays.\n\n> **Note:** Phone numbers and contact details can change over time. If you have trouble reaching HR, you can also visit the official Advance Auto Parts website at **www.advanceautoparts.com** for the most up-to-date contact information.",
